      "B": "Stop after any single subtraction, skipping the need to continue through consecutive odds until $0$ or a pass below $0$.",
      "C": "Keep subtracting $1$, $3$, $5$, $\\ldots$ in order; reaching exactly $0$ after six steps shows $36=6^{2}$.",
